sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as RDP client (mstsc) on the laptop
    participant V as Windows VM in Azure / AWS
    U->>V: connect to public IP or hostname, TCP 3389
    V-->>U: request credentials
    U->>V: username and password
    V-->>U: desktop session starts
    loop while the session is open
        U->>V: keyboard and mouse input
        V-->>U: screen and display updates
    end
